&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Description&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Financial Reporting &amp;amp; Close&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the month-end closure process, ensuring timely completion of books and effective coordination with Business Finance, Accounts Receivable (AR), and Accounts Payable (AP) teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare complete financial statements for the entity and present financial results to internal stakeholders with clarity and actionable insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review and ensure accurate calculation of Expected Credit Loss (ECL) provisions (Ind AS 109) in alignment with the entity’s underlying credit risk, in collaboration with the Risk team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and prepare accounting entries for new or complex transactions, ensuring compliance with applicable accounting standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain strong working knowledge and application of Ind AS 109 (Financial Instruments) and Ind AS 115 (Revenue from Contracts with Customers), with a particular focus on ECL.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Regulatory Compliance &amp;amp; Reporting (NBFC / RBI)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare and file all mandatory RBI returns on a monthly, quarterly, and annual basis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a subject-matter expert on RBI guidelines for NBFCs, including Digital Lending Guidelines and Scale-Based Regulations (SBR), ensuring accurate interpretation and implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with the Compliance team to ensure closure of all RBI compliance-related matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Audit &amp;amp; Governance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the primary point of contact for Internal, Tax, and Statutory auditors, ensuring timely and successful audit completion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with the Secretarial team for quarterly Board Meetings, setting agendas and ensuring all statutory and regulatory resolutions are appropriately passed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor and report all related-party transactions (RPTs), and update the omnibus approval list as new transactions arise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Management &amp;amp; Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in the preparation of the quarterly Board Deck for both the Audit Committee and the Board.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present liquidity risk and key business performance metrics to the ALCO (Asset Liability Committee).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the Treasury team by providing necessary financial data for fund-raising activities and addressing lender queries and requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
