&lt;p&gt;Responsible for research and coverage of high end investment products, this role ensures the firm maintains a live universe of curated investment ideas, supported by data, rationales, and manager intelligence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track new product launches across MF, PMS, AIFs, Structured Products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain a central repository of data, research, and collaterals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Liaise with asset managers to form house views and provide inputs for product whitelisting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop rationales for product approvals to the Investment Committee.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain active touchpoints with fund managers, recording insights and updates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support Wealth Partners with product intelligence and joint calls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
